  "checked": "Real Madrid's next Champions League game: AEK Athens away, Wed 4 Nov 2026 (UEFA + Foot Africa + Sportsdigest). Bellingham born 29 Jun 2003 = 23 years 128 days that day; 231 league games, 54 league goals to 1 Nov 2026; 2024 Champions League winner (Wikipedia). Same age, from each legend's Wikipedia career table: Zidane 29 Oct 1995: 28 league goals in 167 games before 1995-96; Gerrard 5 Oct 2003: 16 PL goals in 136 games before 2003-04; Lampard 26 Oct 2001: 24 PL goals in 148 PL games before 2001-02. Those three dates fall early in a season, so their totals are 'by the start of that season' and shown with a plus. Zidane's 2002, Gerrard's 2005 and Lampard's 2012 Champions League wins are well known. Assists and minutes not confirmable for the 1990s, so goals and games are used. Career tables have one source each.",
