  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "On the fourth of November in Athens, Jude Bellingham is twenty-three years and one hundred and twenty-eight days old.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "title",
        "heading": "JUDE BELLINGHAM",
        "sub": "AEK Athens v Real Madrid · 4 Nov 2026",
        "pill": "AGE-MATCH",
        "person": "jude"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "So let's line him up against the great goal-scoring midfielders at exactly the same age.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "person",
        "person": "jude",
        "label": "23 years, 128 days",
        "mood": "happy"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Bellingham so far: fifty-four league goals in two hundred and thirty-one league games.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "stats",
        "title": "Bellingham, all league games",
        "items": [
          {
            "n": "54",
            "l": "league goals"
          },
          {
            "n": "231",
            "l": "league games"
          }
        ],
        "person": "jude"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Zidane at that age was still at Bordeaux. Twenty-eight league goals, plus a few that autumn.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "person",
        "person": "zidane",
        "label": "Bordeaux, October 1995",
        "mood": "flat"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Steven Gerrard at that age: sixteen Premier League goals. Frank Lampard: twenty-four.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "versus",
        "title": "Same age: 23 years, 128 days",
        "left": {
          "person": "gerrard",
          "label": "Gerrard",
          "value": "16+"
        },
        "right": {
          "person": "lampard",
          "label": "Lampard",
          "value": "24+"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Put them together and Bellingham is miles clear.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "list",
        "title": "League goals at 23y 128d",
        "rows": [
          {
            "name": "Jude Bellingham",
            "value": "54",
            "club": "rma",
            "hl": true
          },
          {
            "name": "Zinedine Zidane",
            "value": "28+",
            "club": "bor"
          },
          {
            "name": "Frank Lampard",
            "value": "24+",
            "club": "che"
          },
          {
            "name": "Steven Gerrard",
            "value": "16+",
            "club": "liv"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "But he's also played more. So match the games.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "stamp",
        "text": "MATCH THE GAMES",
        "person": "jude",
        "color": "yellow"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Per game, Bellingham scores roughly once every four league games. Zidane and Lampard, once every six. Gerrard, once every eight or nine.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "whatif",
        "title": "League games per goal",
        "real": {
          "label": "Bellingham",
          "value": "about 4"
        },
        "alt": {
          "label": "Gerrard",
          "value": "about 8.5"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "And the trophy that matters here? Bellingham won the Champions League before he turned twenty-one.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "trophies",
        "items": [
          {
            "kind": "bigears",
            "label": "Champions League 2024"
          }
        ],
        "person": "jude"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Gerrard had to wait until Istanbul, two thousand five. Zidane until twenty oh-two. Lampard until twenty twelve.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "timeline",
        "items": [
          {
            "year": "2002",
            "label": "Zidane wins it, aged 29"
          },
          {
            "year": "2005",
            "label": "Gerrard wins it, aged 24"
          },
          {
            "year": "2012",
            "label": "Lampard wins it, aged 33"
          },
          {
            "year": "2024",
            "label": "Bellingham wins it, aged 20"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "So is Bellingham already ahead of all three? Tell me in the comments.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "quote",
        "person": "jude",
        "text": "Hey Jude? I'm only twenty-three."
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Follow for more, and play Road to Ballon d'Or at knowitball dot co dot uk.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "cta"
      }
    }
  ]
